to-be-incorporated-into-paper-165 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-165 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: A copattern definition of a value of a codata type may call itself, and the definitions of a `mutual` group may call each" (cons "other. Its value is its stuck call: a neutral of its declared type, holding the definition and its" (cons "arguments. A projection unfolds the call once (the body applied to the same arguments, at the same" (cons "dimensions) and takes the field. Nothing else unfolds it: an application, a comparison, a reading," (cons "and a path application at 0 or 1, which reads the endpoint from the declared type as for any" (cons "neutral path. So a process that never ends is a finite value, an observation of depth n costs n" (cons "unfoldings, and a definition that is its own tail (`zeros`, whose `next` is `zeros`) is held as" (cons "its call. A record stands only as the body of a copattern definition." nil))))))))
